# Networks the hard-cut breaker may pause. One per line.
# Removing a line is how you take a network out of the breaker's reach.
# Adding one is a reviewed change: the probe can only ever PAUSE, but it will
# pause every ENABLED campaign on any network listed here.
#
# x is listed for completeness only. X has no ads API, so its driver returns a
# human checklist (journalled `manual_pending`) rather than stopping anything.
google
reddit
x
